    "text": "In Young&#39;s double slit experiment, intensity at a point is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> of the maximum intensity. Angular position of this point is"
